                            <comment id="16774205" author="rkondakov" created="Thu, 21 Feb 2019 15:45:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=gvvinblade&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;gvvinblade&quot;&gt;gvvinblade&lt;/a&gt;, patch is ready for review. Tests are ok.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16780177" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 28 Feb 2019 06:45:29 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3194165&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16780178" author="rkondakov" created="Thu, 28 Feb 2019 06:46:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=gvvinblade&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;gvvinblade&quot;&gt;gvvinblade&lt;/a&gt;, patch is ready for review. Tests are ok.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16780306" author="gvvinblade" created="Thu, 28 Feb 2019 09:30:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, one comment from me, we shouldn&apos;t split SFU query into two parse results. We need to have all query info in one place. Another point is that inTx flag of &lt;tt&gt;QueryParserCacheKey&lt;/tt&gt; is a part of hash. Since at this point (before parsing) we don&apos;t know whether it&apos;s SFU or not we will duplicate even regular selects into two parse results depending on whether we in tx or not. Please rework it. Everything else is OK.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16782012" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 1 Mar 2019 19:52:10 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3194165&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16782014" author="rkondakov" created="Fri, 1 Mar 2019 19:53:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=gvvinblade&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;gvvinblade&quot;&gt;gvvinblade&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, patch is ready for review. TC looks good.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16786601" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 7 Mar 2019 10:30:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;,&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Let&apos;s replace map queries collection with single object as seems, we always have a single map query for every reduce query.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;It is not clear why we have to save both query versions: with and without &quot;FOR UPDATE&quot; clause. Please, add a bit more info to javadoc for added fields in TwoStepQuery.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Also, I&apos;m not sure if &quot;_key&quot; column is added correctly in case of nested Selects. Most likely it wasn&apos;t work before changes in PR and such changes look ok for now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16790367" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 12 Mar 2019 08:52:22 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3290813&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16790372" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 12 Mar 2019 08:57:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, regarding your comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Done.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Added explanation to javadoc.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;May be you are right about nested select. But since the nested selects are not supported by &quot;SELECT FOR UPDATE&quot; statements, it is not an issue now,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Branch is merged with the latest master. Tests look good. Patch is ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16791473" author="ignitetcbot" created="Wed, 13 Mar 2019 09:08:15 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3299000&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16791474" author="rkondakov" created="Wed, 13 Mar 2019 09:09:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, misprint is fixed, merged with the latest master. Ready for review. Thank you.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16792456" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 14 Mar 2019 08:42:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, there are numerous problems with query and parser models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridCacheSqlQuery.copy() - this change is not legal, &quot;alias&quot; is unused field, and &quot;node&quot; field was not copied intentionally, as it doesn&apos;t make sense at all until the object reaches reducer where separate copies are created for different nodes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridCacheTwoStepQuery - none of new fields are needed. Reduce query field already exist, &quot;forUpdate&quot; map query should be inside map queries as usual, &quot;originalNoForUpdateSql&quot; is not needed either&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;QueryParserResultSelect - original select is not needed, as it is already contained in &lt;tt&gt;QueryDescriptor&lt;/tt&gt; object.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;All in all, I do not think that anything needs to be added to existing cached model, as everything is already there. All we need is to set correct values to exsting fields on parsing/analysis stage.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16795834" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 19 Mar 2019 08:53:46 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3347381&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16795838" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 19 Mar 2019 08:56:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, comments 1 and 2 - fixed. Comment 3 left as is because original query string&#160;in &lt;tt&gt;QueryDescriptor&lt;/tt&gt; may contain &quot;FOR UPDATE&quot; clause. This clause is cleared in &lt;tt&gt;QueryParserResultSelect&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
Tests look good. Patch is ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16801543" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 26 Mar 2019 10:06:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, my comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;QueryParserResultSelect&lt;/tt&gt; - meaning of new String fields is not very intuitive. Can we rename them and associated getters as follows? All these fields should be &lt;tt&gt;null&lt;/tt&gt; for non-SFY case, aren&apos;t they?
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;sqlQry&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;forUpdateQryOutTx&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;sqlQryForUpdate&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;forUpdateQryTx&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;twoStepQryForUpdate&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;forUpdateTwoStepQry&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GridSqlSelect.copy&lt;/tt&gt; looks very suspicious to me. Are we sure that all fields are copied propely? I&apos;d better avoid new copy method and use another call to &lt;tt&gt;parser.parse(prepared)&lt;/tt&gt;. This should not make performance worse as we cache results anyway. Or alternatively we should carefully copy each and every field. If the method should not copy all fields due to some SFU specifics, then it should be named properly (e.g. not &lt;tt&gt;copy&lt;/tt&gt;, but &lt;tt&gt;copyForSelectForUpdate&lt;/tt&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GridSqlQuerySplitter&lt;/tt&gt; - should splitter be concerned with query rewrite and SFU flag at all? This is not obvious. Can we do all necessary rewrite on parsing stage instead of splitting it between parser and splitter?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16803679" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 28 Mar 2019 08:11:50 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3434844&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16803766" author="rkondakov" created="Thu, 28 Mar 2019 09:52:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, regarding your comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fields have been renamed.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GridSqlSelect.copy&lt;/tt&gt; has been renamed to &lt;tt&gt;GridSqlSelect.copyForSelectForUpdate&lt;/tt&gt;. This copy is needed to change it&apos;s AST later by adding a &lt;tt&gt;_key&lt;/tt&gt; column. We do not want to change the original query AST in this way. &lt;tt&gt;parser.parse(prepared)&lt;/tt&gt; is not useful here because due to a caching it would return exactly the same object, but not a copy.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SELECT FOR UPDATE&lt;/tt&gt; logic has been removed from splitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Now waiting for visa from TC bot.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16804092" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 28 Mar 2019 16:31:23 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3441945&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16804093" author="rkondakov" created="Thu, 28 Mar 2019 16:32:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, please review the patch. Tests are ok.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
